<div class="p4-banner">
    <div class="p4-phase-pill">Phase 4 · Rail-Driven Piston Transmission</div>
    <h1>Steam-Rail <em>Reverse-Drive</em> Transmission System</h1>
    <p>
        A clean-architecture retrofit where high-pressure steam drives a reciprocating
        rail system that pushes stationary pistons directly into a transmission block.
        The rail does the motion; the pistons receive force. No sealed piston chambers,
        no oil/water contamination, pure linear-to-transmission power transfer.
    </p>
</div>

